{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"tXMFelqBFJ7S"},"source":["# Kuggle 8주차 과제 · CNN으로 이미지 분류하기\n","\n","**목표** — 손글씨 숫자 이미지를 분류하는 작은 CNN을 완성하고, 실제 예측 결과로 정확도와 오분류를 해석합니다.\n","\n","1. Google Colab에서 이 노트북을 엽니다. 기본 CPU 런타임으로 실행할 수 있습니다.\n","2. 위에서부터 실행하면서 `TODO 1~3`의 `None`을 정수로 바꾸세요. 이미지 데이터는 scikit-learn에 내장되어 있습니다.\n","3. 마지막에 **단답형 3문항**을 작성하고, 그래프와 실행 결과가 보이는 `.ipynb`를 GitHub에 올리세요.\n","\n","평가 기준은 **빈칸 완성, 코드 실행, 단답형 답안**입니다. 특정 정확도를 맞힐 필요는 없습니다."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"igVJIEYzFJ7U"},"source":["## 01. 이미지와 픽셀 · 손글씨 숫자 살펴보기\n","\n","숫자 0-9를 손으로 쓴 8x8 회색조 이미지 1,797장을 사용합니다. 각 이미지는 채널이 하나인 **1 x 8 x 8** 배열입니다. 밝기 값(0-16)은 16으로 나눠 0-1 범위로 바꿉니다.\n","\n","데이터를 섞어 **학습 1,200장 / 검증 300장 / 테스트 297장**으로 나눕니다. `DataLoader`는 여러 이미지를 묶어 배치 단위로 모델에 전달합니다."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"x8SN2r19FJ7V","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795362723193,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":8310,"user":{"displayName":"박서린","userId":"02067760516121580326"}},"outputId":"09493f3c-5545-4fe9-d158-de44666ecddd"},"source":["import copy\n","\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import torch\n","from torch import nn\n","from sklearn.datasets import load_digits\n","from torch.utils.data import DataLoader, TensorDataset, random_split\n","\n","SEED = 777\n","BATCH_SIZE = 64\n","EPOCHS = 5\n","LEARNING_RATE = 0.001\n","\n","torch.manual_seed(SEED)\n","device = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n","if device.type == 'cpu':\n","    torch.set_num_threads(min(4, torch.get_num_threads()))\n","print('Device:', device)"],"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Device: cpu\n"]}],"execution_count":1},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"Bsv8-A6sFJ7X","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":464},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795362795233,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":153,"user":{"displayName":"박서린","userId":"02067760516121580326"}},"outputId":"91cc8f3a-1679-47d7-88e9-5fb72d500386"},"source":["digits = load_digits()  # scikit-learn 패키지에 포함된 이미지\n","images = torch.tensor(digits.images, dtype=torch.float32).unsqueeze(1) / 16.0\n","labels = torch.tensor(digits.target, dtype=torch.long)\n","dataset = TensorDataset(images, labels)\n","\n","train_data, val_data, test_data = random_split(\n","    dataset, [1200, 300, 297], generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED)\n",")\n","class_names = [str(number) for number in range(10)]\n","\n","train_loader = DataLoader(train_data, batch_size=BATCH_SIZE, shuffle=True,\n","                          generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(SEED))\n","val_loader = DataLoader(val_data, batch_size=BATCH_SIZE, shuffle=False)\n","\n","sample_image, sample_label = train_data[0]\n","print('Image shape (C, H, W):', tuple(sample_image.shape))\n","print('Train / validation / test:', len(train_data), '/', len(val_data), '/', len(test_data))\n","plt.imshow(sample_image[0], cmap='gray', vmin=0, vmax=1, interpolation='nearest')\n","plt.title(class_names[sample_label.item()])\n","plt.axis('off')\n","plt.show()"],"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Image shape (C, H, W): (1, 8, 8)\n","Train / validation / test: 1200 / 300 / 297\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}],"execution_count":4},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"z5RkFKjnFJ7Y"},"source":["## 02. CNN의 특징 추출 · 합성곱과 맥스 풀링\n","\n","합성곱 → ReLU → 맥스 풀링을 한 블록으로 묶어 두 번 적용합니다. 아래 표는 **이미지 한 장** 기준의 크기입니다.\n","\n","| 단계 | 출력 형태 |\n","|---|---|\n","| 회색조 입력 | 1 × 8 × 8 |\n","| 첫 블록의 합성곱 | 16 × 8 × 8 |\n","| 첫 블록의 풀링 | 16 × 4 × 4 |\n","| 두 번째 블록의 합성곱 | 32 × 4 × 4 |\n","| 두 번째 블록의 풀링 | 32 × 2 × 2 |\n","| Flatten | 길이 = 채널 수 × 높이 × 너비 |\n","| 완전연결층 | 클래스별 점수 10개 |\n","\n","- **TODO 1** — 회색조 입력의 채널 수. 위 표에서 입력의 첫 번째 숫자를 확인하세요.\n","- **TODO 2** — 2×2 풀링 창이 겹치지 않게 한 번에 이동하는 칸 수. 창의 한 변 길이만큼 이동합니다.\n","- **TODO 3** — 두 번째 풀링 출력의 채널 × 높이 × 너비를 곱한 값."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"_-tzx12XFJ7Z","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795362790499,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":54,"user":{"displayName":"박서린","userId":"02067760516121580326"}},"outputId":"0ae06fb8-f92c-4b51-f382-3abdbcb7e600"},"source":["INPUT_CHANNELS = 1  # TODO 1\n","POOL_STRIDE = 2     # TODO 2\n","FLAT_FEATURES = 128    # TODO 3\n","PADDING = 1             # 합성곱 전후 가로·세로 크기 유지\n","\n","settings = (INPUT_CHANNELS, POOL_STRIDE, FLAT_FEATURES)\n","if any(value is None for value in settings):\n","    raise ValueError('이 셀의 TODO 1~3을 모두 채운 뒤 다시 실행하세요.')\n","\n","block1 = nn.Sequential(\n","    nn.Conv2d(INPUT_CHANNELS, 16, kernel_size=3, stride=1, padding=PADDING),\n","    nn.ReLU(),\n","    nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2, stride=POOL_STRIDE),\n",")\n","block2 = nn.Sequential(\n","    nn.Conv2d(16, 32, kernel_size=3, stride=1, padding=PADDING),\n","    nn.ReLU(),\n","    nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2, stride=POOL_STRIDE),\n",")\n","model = nn.Sequential(\n","    block1,\n","    block2,\n","    nn.Flatten(start_dim=1),  # 배치 축은 유지\n","    nn.Linear(FLAT_FEATURES, len(class_names)),\n",").to(device)\n","\n","# 실제 이미지 한 장으로 학습 전 출력 크기 확인\n","with torch.no_grad():\n","    sample_batch = sample_image.unsqueeze(0).to(device)\n","    features1 = block1(sample_batch)\n","    features2 = block2(features1)\n","    flat = model[2](features2)\n","    print('Block 1:', tuple(features1.shape))\n","    print('Block 2:', tuple(features2.shape))\n","    print('Flatten:', tuple(flat.shape))\n","    if flat.shape[1] != FLAT_FEATURES:\n","        raise ValueError('Flatten 길이를 확인하고 TODO 1~3을 다시 살펴보세요.')\n","    print('Logits:', tuple(model[3](flat).shape))"],"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Block 1: (1, 16, 4, 4)\n","Block 2: (1, 32, 2, 2)\n","Flatten: (1, 128)\n","Logits: (1, 10)\n"]}],"execution_count":3},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"EKsuG94tFJ7Z"},"source":["## 03. 분류와 학습 · 점수로 손실을 계산하고 가중치 갱신\n","\n","완전연결층은 이미지별 클래스 점수(**logits**)를 출력합니다.\n","`CrossEntropyLoss`에 logits와 정답 클래스 번호를 전달합니다. Softmax 확률은 예측 예시를 읽을 때 사용합니다.\n","\n","이미지마다 점수가 가장 높은 클래스를 예측으로 선택합니다."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"5QRm8oU0FJ7a","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795362801258,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":3,"user":{"displayName":"박서린","userId":"02067760516121580326"}}},"source":["def predict_classes(logits):\n","    return logits.argmax(dim=1)\n","\n","loss_fn = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n","\n","@torch.no_grad()\n","def evaluate(model, loader):\n","    model.eval()\n","    total_loss = 0.0\n","    correct = 0\n","    total = 0\n","    for images, labels in loader:\n","        images, labels = images.to(device), labels.to(device)\n","        logits = model(images)\n","        total_loss += loss_fn(logits, labels).item() * len(labels)\n","        correct += (predict_classes(logits) == labels).sum().item()\n","        total += len(labels)\n","    return total_loss / total, correct / total"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":5},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"lXMYQOisFJ7a","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795362813862,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":8122,"user":{"displayName":"박서린","userId":"02067760516121580326"}},"outputId":"69226d86-3e56-4020-d485-26be8f7f61fe"},"source":["# 다시 학습하려면 02절 모델 정의 셀부터 실행하세요.\n","optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=LEARNING_RATE)\n","train_losses, val_losses = [], []\n","best_val_loss = float('inf')\n","\n","for epoch in range(1, EPOCHS + 1):\n","    model.train()\n","    running_loss = 0.0\n","    for images, labels in train_loader:\n","        images, labels = images.to(device), labels.to(device)\n","        optimizer.zero_grad()               # 이전 배치의 기울기 초기화\n","        logits = model(images)              # 순전파\n","        loss = loss_fn(logits, labels)       # 손실 계산\n","        loss.backward()                     # 역전파\n","        optimizer.step()                    # 필터와 분류기의 가중치 갱신\n","        running_loss += loss.item() * len(labels)\n","\n","    train_loss = running_loss / len(train_data)\n","    val_loss, val_acc = evaluate(model, val_loader)\n","    train_losses.append(train_loss)\n","    val_losses.append(val_loss)\n","    if val_loss < best_val_loss:\n","        best_val_loss = val_loss\n","        best_epoch = epoch\n","        best_weights = copy.deepcopy(model.state_dict())\n","    print(f'Epoch {epoch:02d} | train loss {train_loss:.3f} | '\n","          f'val loss {val_loss:.3f} | val accuracy {val_acc:.1%}')\n","\n","model.load_state_dict(best_weights)\n","print(f'검증 손실이 가장 낮은 모델: epoch {best_epoch}')"],"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Epoch 01 | train loss 2.252 | val loss 2.191 | val accuracy 40.0%\n","Epoch 02 | train loss 2.117 | val loss 2.016 | val accuracy 60.0%\n","Epoch 03 | train loss 1.876 | val loss 1.703 | val accuracy 78.0%\n","Epoch 04 | train loss 1.496 | val loss 1.278 | val accuracy 81.0%\n","Epoch 05 | train loss 1.071 | val loss 0.891 | val accuracy 85.0%\n","검증 손실이 가장 낮은 모델: epoch 5\n"]}],"execution_count":6},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"-hr46-3-FJ7a"},"source":["epochs = range(1, EPOCHS + 1)\n","plt.plot(epochs, train_losses, marker='o', label='Train loss')\n","plt.plot(epochs, val_losses, marker='o', label='Validation loss')\n","plt.axvline(best_epoch, color='gray', linestyle='--', label='Selected epoch')\n","plt.xticks(list(epochs))\n","plt.xlabel('Epoch')\n","plt.ylabel('Cross-entropy loss')\n","plt.legend()\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"6OBwbQVGFJ7b"},"source":["## 04. 모델 평가 · 정확도, 혼동행렬, 오분류\n","\n","검증 손실로 선택한 모델을 따로 떼어 둔 테스트 데이터에서 평가합니다. 혼동행렬의 **행은 실제 클래스, 열은 예측 클래스**입니다. 아래의 사진과 예측값은 이번 실행에서 얻은 결과입니다."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"OUUzRFZrFJ7b","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":743},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795362825024,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":574,"user":{"displayName":"박서린","userId":"02067760516121580326"}},"outputId":"89398fb8-775f-48f9-d42b-12faa095f9c0"},"source":["test_loader = DataLoader(test_data, batch_size=BATCH_SIZE, shuffle=False)\n","\n","true_batches, pred_batches, confidence_batches = [], [], []\n","model.eval()\n","with torch.no_grad():\n","    for images, labels in test_loader:\n","        logits = model(images.to(device))\n","        predicted = predict_classes(logits)\n","        probabilities = logits.softmax(dim=1)\n","        confidence = probabilities.gather(1, predicted.unsqueeze(1)).squeeze(1)\n","        true_batches.append(labels)\n","        pred_batches.append(predicted.cpu())\n","        confidence_batches.append(confidence.cpu())\n","\n","true_labels = torch.cat(true_batches)\n","pred_labels = torch.cat(pred_batches)\n","confidences = torch.cat(confidence_batches)\n","num_classes = len(class_names)\n","\n","# (실제, 예측) 쌍을 행 우선 순서로 세어 10 × 10 표 구성\n","pair_ids = num_classes * true_labels + pred_labels\n","cm = torch.bincount(pair_ids, minlength=num_classes ** 2).reshape(num_classes, num_classes)\n","accuracy = cm.diag().sum().item() / cm.sum().item()\n","print(f'Test accuracy: {accuracy:.1%} ({cm.diag().sum().item()} / {len(test_data)})')\n","\n","fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(9, 7))\n","heatmap = ax.imshow(cm.numpy(), cmap='Blues')\n","ax.set_xticks(range(num_classes), class_names, rotation=45, ha='right')\n","ax.set_yticks(range(num_classes), class_names)\n","ax.set(xlabel='Predicted class', ylabel='True class', title='Confusion matrix')\n","for row in range(num_classes):\n","    for col in range(num_classes):\n","        count = cm[row, col].item()\n","        color = 'white' if count > cm.max().item() / 2 else 'black'\n","        ax.text(col, row, count, ha='center', va='center', color=color, fontsize=8)\n","fig.colorbar(heatmap, ax=ax, label='Images')\n","fig.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n","\n","errors_only = cm.clone()\n","errors_only.fill_diagonal_(0)\n","if errors_only.sum().item() > 0:\n","    row, col = divmod(errors_only.argmax().item(), num_classes)\n","    print(f'가장 많은 오분류 중 하나: {class_names[row]} → {class_names[col]} '\n","          f'({errors_only[row, col].item()}장)')"],"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Test accuracy: 84.8% (252 / 297)\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 900x700 with 2 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["가장 많은 오분류 중 하나: 8 → 9 (7장)\n"]}],"execution_count":7},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"TgF5pvcUFJ7b","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":707},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795362828799,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":493,"user":{"displayName":"박서린","userId":"02067760516121580326"}},"outputId":"39de197f-fbe4-4422-a768-513ea909660f"},"source":["error_indices = (true_labels != pred_labels).nonzero(as_tuple=True)[0]\n","if len(error_indices) == 0:\n","    print('오분류 이미지가 없습니다.')\n","else:\n","    count = min(6, len(error_indices))\n","    fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(11, 7))\n","    for ax in axes.flat:\n","        ax.axis('off')\n","    # 테스트 로더를 섞지 않았으므로, 예측 위치와 test_data의 인덱스가 일치\n","    for ax, index in zip(axes.flat, error_indices[:count].tolist()):\n","        image, actual = test_data[index]\n","        predicted = pred_labels[index].item()\n","        ax.imshow(image[0], cmap='gray', vmin=0, vmax=1, interpolation='nearest')\n","        ax.set_title(f'True: {class_names[actual.item()]}\\n'\n","                     f'Pred: {class_names[predicted]} ({confidences[index].item():.0%})')\n","    fig.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()"],"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1100x700 with 6 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}],"execution_count":8},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"P6Lxb-59FJ7b"},"source":["## 제출 답안 · 숫자만 적기\n","\n","1. 두 번째 풀링 결과를 펼친 벡터의 길이는?12.8개\n","2. 검증 손실이 가장 낮아서 선택된 모델은 몇 번째 epoch인가요? 5번째\n","3. 테스트 정확도는? 84.8%"]}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"},"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"1S_lk1Vk2V7WwLV-m3IM920PRf84rFtPG","timestamp":1795363528725}]}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0}